---
title: No Bake Cookies
source: Matt
servings: 4
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 25 minutes
---

Combine @sugar{2%cups}, @butter{4%tbsp}, and @cocoa{1/4%cups} in a #saucepan{} and bring to a slow boil.

Turn off the heat and add @vanilla{2%tsp} and @peanut butter{1/2%cups}, then mix well until creamy and smooth before folding in @quick oats{3%cups}.

Drop by spoonful onto wax paper to set. These can be put in the fridge to speed the setting, but they will harden with time on the counter.
